 Social Media Engagement Analysis

 Project Overview
An interactive Power BI dashboard for monitoring social media engagement and campaign performance.

 Key Analysis
- Analyzed post impressions, reach, shares, and engagement across social media platforms.
- Compared performance by platform, media type, campaign, and engagement type.
- Evaluated mentions, hashtags, and campaign metrics to understand content performance.
- Built an interactive dashboard for monitoring social media engagement and campaign performance.

 Tools & Technologies
- Power BI
- Data Analysis
- Data Visualization

 Dashboard
The dashboard provides interactive analysis of social media engagement and campaign performance.
